pot.com/2011/04/yummy-yummy-gingerbreak.html","http://forum.xda-developers.com/showthread.php?t=1044765","http://www.androidpolice.com/2011/05/03/google-patches-gingerbreak-exploit-but-dont-worry-we-still-have-root-for-now/","http://xorl.wordpress.com/2011/04/28/android-vold-mpartminors-signedness-issue/","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/67977","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2011-1823","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2011/CVE-2011-1823.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/12727e3592f49e8b84f175342289fe42f4fbf6ad/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/AndroidOS/Exploit/CVE-2011-1823.yara","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2011/1xxx/CVE-2011-1823.json","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/AndroidOS/CVE-2011-1823/Exploit_AndroidOS_CVE-2011-1823.yar","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-1823","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2011/1xxx/CVE-2011-1823.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/nvd_advisories/CVE-2011-1823.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2011-1823.html","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/ucam-cl-dtg/android-vulnerabilities/blob/5a5158e5faea7de3fdbb822e6f64d1cd713aebcf/cvetobib.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0057","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-0628","title":"Adobe Flash Player 整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 在处理 ActionScript 长数组对象时存在整数溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问包含恶意 SWF 文件的网页触发该漏洞，成功利用可在受影响系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux、Solaris 平台上 10.3.181.14 之前版本以及 Android 平台上 10.3.185.21 之前版本的 Flash Player，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。Adobe 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-0628"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-05-31T20:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:27:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.181.14 及以上版本（Windows/Mac/Linux/Solaris）或 10.3.185.21 及以上版本（Android）。由于 Adobe 已于 2020 年底停止 Flash Player 支持并发布 EOL 公告，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并迁移至 HTML5 标准，同时在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://labs.idefense.com/intelligence/vulnerabilities/display.php?id=908","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-12.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/47961","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/67638","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13994","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15639","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2011/0xxx/CVE-2011-0628.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-0628","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-0628","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-0628","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-0628","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-0628.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2011/CVE-2011-0628.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-0628.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-0628","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/0xxx/CVE-2011-0628.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0056","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-0627","title":"Adobe Flash Player 内存破坏漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player在处理特制Flash内容时存在内存破坏漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开包含恶意嵌入.swf文件的Microsoft Office文档或访问恶意网页触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上执行任意代码或导致拒绝服务。该漏洞源于Flash Player对畸形SWF文件输入验证不足，造成内存损坏。影响Windows、Mac OS X、Linux、Solaris及Android平台上的Flash Player 10.3.181.14之前版本（Android为10.3.185.21之前版本）。该漏洞已在2011年5月被野外利用，CVSS评分8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-0627"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-05-13T22:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-23T16:16:56Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.181.14 及以上版本（Windows/Mac/Linux/Solaris）或 10.3.185.21 及以上版本（Android）。由于 Adobe 已于 2020 年 12 月 31 日停止 Flash Player 支持并推荐卸载，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 组件，并在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件。对于必须使用 Flash 的遗留系统，可部署应用白名单策略限制 .swf 文件来源，并在 Microsoft Office 中禁用 ActiveX 控件加载 Flash 内容。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-05/msg00006.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-12.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13914","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16053","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e42829e595f1a9b61ce455f2ab870c6325fb1ad/cves/2011/0xxx/CVE-2011-0627.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d