0619"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-05-13T22:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:27:45Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.181.14 及以上版本（Windows/Mac/Linux/Solaris）或 10.3.185.21 及以上版本（Android）。由于 Flash Player 已停止支持并存在大量已知漏洞，强烈建议彻底卸载 Flash Player，改用 HTML5 替代方案。如业务必须使用，可在浏览器中启用 click-to-play 插件策略，并限制仅访问受信任站点。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-05/msg00006.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-12.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14088","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16141","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e9d9f63ec95233a18ff0c401191fddd414b539a/cves/2011/0xxx/CVE-2011-0619.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-0619","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2011-0619.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-h9rp-x69r-m5cg/GHSA-h9rp-x69r-m5cg.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-0619","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9fb6bc21273092ff8b91677561ee0f67b063fcda/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-0619.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_suse_2011_025.nasl","https://github.com/SuperCowPowers/data_hacking/blob/cc828b5051f935aaafdeae0bc9de06e8f2f687db/swf_classification/data/malicious/6bc858862170e46ee1aa1b3a0943e9f8e76e286082ecb5c2d21da51428f3d372.vtdata","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2011/FreeBSD-2011-0073.md","https://github.com/DragonFlyBSD/DPorts/blob/e2f3